{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a1-explainer-about-sports-which-sports-are-well-known-which-are-the-most-famous-and-why-fo/audio/main-98b522313a64.mp3","durationSec":173.616,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.8,"text":"A **well-known** sport is a sport that many people know."},{"start":3.54,"end":6.46,"text":"A **popular** sport has many players or fans."},{"start":7.3,"end":11.7,"text":"A sport can be very famous in one place but less famous in another."},{"start":11.7,"end":15.98,"text":"Baseball is a top sport in Japan and several other countries."},{"start":15.98,"end":18.74,"text":"Football is popular across the world."},{"start":19.28,"end":22.2,"text":"We can use three ideas: Do many people play it?"},{"start":22.64,"end":23.72,"text":"Do many people watch it?"},{"start":24.28,"end":26.14,"text":"Does it have a strong story or tradition?"},{"start":26.78,"end":31.32,"text":"Football, also called soccer, is the world’s most popular sport."},{"start":32.18,"end":37.32,"text":"About 250 million people play it in more than 200 countries and territories."},{"start":38.26,"end":41.48,"text":"Two teams of 11 players try to kick a ball into a goal."},{"start":41.48,"end":46.84,"text":"Football is easy to start: children often need only a ball and an open space."},{"start":47.44,"end":50.44,"text":"People can play at school, in a park, or in the street."},{"start":51.18,"end":54.36,"text":"This helps football become famous almost everywhere."},{"start":55.07,"end":57.92,"text":"Big events help sports become more famous."},{"start":57.92,"end":61.1,"text":"The FIFA World Cup happens every four years."},{"start":61.74,"end":65.56,"text":"About 1.5 billion people watched the 2022 final in Qatar."},{"start":65.56,"end":69.82,"text":"Countries wait a long time for this special event, so it feels important."},{"start":70.62,"end":72.02,"text":"The Olympic Games are also famous."},{"start":72.58,"end":74.46,"text":"They bring many sports and countries together."},{"start":75.08,"end":80.7,"text":"At Tokyo 2020, more than 11,300 athletes from 206 nations competed."},{"start":81.44,"end":85.38,"text":"Viewers can see running, swimming, football, and many other sports."},{"start":85.38,"end":88.94,"text":"Basketball has two teams with five players on each side."},{"start":88.94,"end":91.1,"text":"Players shoot a ball through a high hoop."},{"start":91.88,"end":95.72,"text":"The NBA is its most famous professional league, with 30 teams."},{"start":96.38,"end":99.4,"text":"School gyms and street courts also help people play the game."},{"start":99.4,"end":103.66,"text":"Tennis can be one player against one player, or two against two."},{"start":104.18,"end":106.68,"text":"Its four Grand Slam events are very famous."},{"start":107.24,"end":111.72,"text":"Wimbledon began in London in 1877 and is the oldest tennis tournament."},{"start":112.5,"end":115.72,"text":"Some sports are especially famous in certain parts of the world."},{"start":116.58,"end":119.3,"text":"Baseball is a top sport in Japan and the Americas."},{"start":120.12,"end":123.98,"text":"Two teams of nine players hit, throw, and run around four bases."},{"start":124.72,"end":127.6,"text":"The World Series is the championship of Major League Baseball."},{"start":127.6,"end":131.96,"text":"Cricket is especially famous in South Asia, Australia, and England."},{"start":132.48,"end":134.54,"text":"Two teams of 11 use a bat and ball."},{"start":135.42,"end":139.44,"text":"About 90 percent of cricket’s billion-plus fans are in South Asia."},{"start":140.06,"end":141.5,"text":"Place can make a big difference."},{"start":142.4,"end":145.06,"text":"There is no single reason why a sport becomes famous."},{"start":146.04,"end":148.94,"text":"Football is simple to start and has fans around the world."},{"start":149.6,"end":152.84,"text":"The World Cup and Olympic Games bring many countries together."},{"start":153.62,"end":156.56,"text":"Basketball has famous professional teams and local courts."},{"start":156.56,"end":159.68,"text":"Tennis has old events such as Wimbledon."},{"start":160.26,"end":162.52,"text":"Baseball and cricket have strong local traditions."},{"start":163.3,"end":169.46,"text":"A sport grows when children can play it, families watch it, and important games create exciting stories."},{"start":170.38,"end":173.08,"text":"The most famous sport can also be different in each place."}],"words":[{"text":"A","start":0,"end":0.16},{"text":"well-known","start":0.16,"end":0.56},{"text":"sport","start":0.56,"end":0.96},{"text":"is","start":0.96,"end":1.38},{"text":"a","start":1.38,"end":1.54},{"text":"sport","start":1.54,"end":1.74},{"text":"that","start":1.74,"end":1.96},{"text":"many","start":1.96,"end":2.16},{"text":"people","start":2.16,"end":2.44},{"text":"know","start":2.44,"end":2.8},{"text":"A","start":3.54,"end":3.62},{"text":"popular","start":3.62,"end":4},{"text":"sport","start":4,"end":4.5},{"text":"has","start":4.5,"end":4.8},{"text":"many","start":4.8,"end":5.14},{"text":"players","start":5.14,"end":5.6},{"text":"or","start":5.6,"end":5.98},{"text":"fans","start":5.98,"end":6.46},{"text":"A","start":7.3,"end":7.36},{"text":"sport","start":7.36,"end":7.62},{"text":"can","start":7.62,"end":7.84},{"text":"be","start":7.84,"end":8},{"text":"very","start":8,"end":8.26},{"text":"famous","start":8.26,"end":8.64},{"text":"in","start":8.64,"end":8.88},{"text":"one","start":8.88,"end":9.08},{"text":"place","start":9.08,"end":9.52},{"text":"but","start":9.84,"end":9.96},{"text":"less","start":9.96,"end":10.22},{"text":"famous","start":10.22,"end":10.64},{"text":"in","start":10.64,"end":11.32},{"text":"another","start":11.32,"end":11.7},{"text":"Baseball","start":11.7,"end":12.96},{"text":"is","start":12.96,"end":13.22},{"text":"a","start":13.22,"end":13.36},{"text":"top","start":13.36,"end":13.54},{"text":"sport","start":13.54,"end":13.88},{"text":"in","start":13.88,"end":14.12},{"text":"Japan","start